<title>USA: 360, BellSouth transfer property interests.</title>
<headline>360, BellSouth transfer property interests.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>360 Communications Co said Wednesday it completed its previously announced agreement with BellSouth Corp to transfer ownership interests in two markets.</p>
<p>360 acquired BellSouth's 10 percent ownership interest in the Tallahassee, Fla., cellular system, giving 360 Communications 100 percent ownership interest in that market. In addition, BellSouth acquired 360's cellular system serving the Dothan, Ala., area.</p>
<p>360 provides wireless voice and data services to nearly 2.3 million customers in more than 100 markets in 16 states.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
